#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:37
msgid "Mission Planner Antenna Tracking"
msgstr "Mission Planner 天线追踪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:37
msgid "Antenna Design Overview"
msgstr "天线设计概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:5
#: 363e79a73543433cbf711c2dac94b7a8 7ce0f1f8d1994e71b81ca130cd19941f
#: ce459e04b29d4a4ab113766af56245af f8db5b33216049c88004a8867e11cd6c
msgid "Antenna Tracking"
msgstr "天线追踪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:7
#: 3d337bd9e3d34284b8e06635f8378627 5a4f4beaeac34b24be8cabfa56664547
#: a7b1b7e1cec74771bbc5869f84e5291b b0b00e4d0a1e44e1ae3f86e2f5ae06b4
msgid ""
"*Antenna Trackers* are systems that track your vehicle's location, and use "
"this information to correctly align a directional antenna. This approach "
"significantly improves the range over which signals can be both sent and "
"received from the ground station."
msgstr "*天线追踪器* 是一种追踪飞行器位置并利用这些信息正确对准定向天线的系统。这种方法可以显著提高地面站与飞行器之间的信号发送和接收范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:12
#: 05cc39b1f0734d5789b4a2a97de37168
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports two methods for Antenna Tracking. Both methods use GPS "
"information from the vehicle and ground station to aim the antenna. The main"
" difference is that the :ref:`AntennaTracker <antennatracker:home>` is "
"independent of any particular GCS."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持两种天线追踪方法。两种方法都使用来自飞行器和地面站的 GPS 信息来瞄准天线。主要区别在于 "
":ref:`AntennaTracker <antennatracker:home>` 独立于任何特定 GCS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:18
#: bb41614b87ca4f6992e2ac4abad1832f
msgid ":ref:`AntennaTracker <antennatracker:home>`"
msgstr ":ref:`AntennaTracker <antennatracker:home>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:20
#: 1cdeb893f8904753b74c893fab2a909f
msgid ""
"The AntennaTracker firmware turns an ArduPilot-supported board "
"(:ref:`common-autopilots` ) into the controller for an antenna tracker."
msgstr ""
"AntennaTracker 固件可将 ArduPilot 支持的飞控板（:ref:`common-autopilots`）变成天线追踪器的控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:16
#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:22
#: 0948bceedc534cf58a37d9a78170d84f 5fae692b53d14f8b9c942e05788e54bb
#: c568c51a2a5447a6a852e992531e98e5 d4a311bba1b04d2c80aacf97363b25c8
msgid ""
"The board calculates the required antenna direction and can drive the "
"antenna's servos directly."
msgstr "该飞控板计算所需的天线方向，并可直接驱动天线的舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:17
#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:24
#: 63ce618bc1a14f12803a664040af917a 790e24a77fad4082a185c667fd29ce73
#: daa1cc88774b424badeb57a766536ebc e1b91f05420642b88c37ea7e8bf482a4
msgid "Mission Planner (or any other GCS) may be used, but is not required."
msgstr "可以使用 Mission Planner（或任何其他 GCS），但不是必须的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:26
