msgstr "运行 Mission Planner 的 PC 必须具备 GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-antenna-tracking.rst:31
#: e983f236d3bf424f9e639ec6fd2fa78c
msgid "You will need a special servo driver board to control the servo's."
msgstr "您需要一块特殊的舵机驱动板来控制舵机。"

